[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0010","text":"等等，路加"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0020","text":"干什么……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0030","text":"至少等待的时间里别管我了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0040","text":"啊……抱歉\n有点话想跟你说……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0050","text":"路加……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0060","text":"能不能再多——……\n跟人交流一些……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0070","text":"哈…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0080","text":"不……\n当然不是说强迫你……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0090","text":"你在说什么啊\n……我想怎样是我的自由吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0100","text":"啊，虽然是这样没错……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0110","text":"……你到底想说什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0120","text":"不……\n怎么说呢————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0130","text":"看着路加……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0140","text":"感觉你比以前\n更把人拒之千里了————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0150","text":"…………那又怎样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0160","text":"斑鸠小姐，差不多该去摄影棚了——\n拜托了——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0170","text":"啊，好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0180","text":"不需要…………\n那种东西————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01260000_01_0190","text":"………………"}]
